{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1523038492,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMTIwNjkzMzU=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2392","origin":"github"},"title":"We need test \"bots\" for result handling","message":"Cases like #1963 can happen in tons of places and it is not feasible to have dedicated tests for such combinatorial problems for each manifestations. We should develop an approach that allows us to inject test code in the central bits of our result processing that can, for example, verify the internal consistency of any result dataset seen during an entire test run. In the case of #1963 we want a policy check that ensures that any `path` property is always an absolute path.","files":null}]}